{"ts":1793396457071,"event":"done","summary":"validateApp now throws when app.owner is missing or blank. shared-contracts bumped 1.0.0 -> 2.0.0 (breaking, published by CD). All three callers pass owner from package.json team: core-shell=platform, billing=payments, reports=insights. Apps moved to @mfe/shared-contracts ^2.0.0 with lockfile updates. PRs #1 (contracts), #2 (shell), #3 (billing), #4 (reports) merged; CI and CD green. Assumptions: owner is hard-coded in each app's source to match package.json team (the bundle is browser code, so package.json isn't read at runtime); a major bump was chosen because existing 1.x callers without owner now throw; apps stay on ^1.0.0 until they are moved, which is why they were moved in the same ticket after 2.0.0 was published. platformkit has no validateApp callers and was not changed."}
